   "index": "aM",
   "text": "• Dashboard — Needs you (your tasks, decisions, ✦ proposals, overdue) › At risk › On track\n• My tasks — assigned to you + (Organizer) everything not yet delegated · [Delegate] on each\n• Guests — RSVP list, allergies/hotel (only to owning Role), remind non-responders\n• Timeline — one swimlane per Role, read-only, horizontal scroll\n• Team & Roles — Organizer: activate Roles, assign/revoke, set Role lead · others: who's who\n• Announcements — send to person / Role / group · flat feed\n• Landing page & Run of Show — draft → Organizer reviews → Publish\n• Event settings (Organizer)",
   "originalText": "• Dashboard — Needs you (your tasks, decisions, ✦ proposals, overdue) › At risk › On track\n• My tasks — assigned to you + (Organizer) everything not yet delegated · [Delegate] on each\n• Guests — RSVP list, allergies/hotel (only to owning Role), remind non-responders\n• Timeline — one swimlane per Role, read-only, horizontal scroll\n• Team & Roles — Organizer: activate Roles, assign/revoke, set Role lead · others: who's who\n• Announcements — send to person / Role / group · flat feed\n• Landing page & Run of Show — draft → Organizer reviews → Publish\n• Event settings (Organizer)",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
